      "content": "原价是 399 元，但是今天在直播间，只要 199！直接对半砍！",
      "word_count": 32,
      "speech_type": "待分析",
      "is_highlight": false,
      "is_crash": false
    },
    {
      "segment_id": 4,
      "start_time": "00:01:30",
      "end_time": "00:02:00",
      "content": "想要的宝宝赶紧扣 1 让我看到你们的热情！点赞到 1 万我们再加赠 100 单！",
      "word_count": 40,
      "speech_type": "待分析",
      "is_highlight": false,
      "is_crash": false
    },
    {
      "segment_id": 5,
      "start_time": "00:02:00",
      "end_time": "00:02:30",
      "content": "这款精华液是全网销量第一的，绝对有效，保证你用了之后皮肤水水嫩嫩的。",
      "word_count": 34,
      "speech_type": "待分析",
      "is_highlight": false,
      "is_crash": false
    },
    {
      "segment_id": 6,
      "start_time": "00:02:30",
      "end_time": "00:03:00",
      "content": "我跟你们说，别家那些都是假货，只有我们这里是官方授权，正品保证。",
      "word_count": 32,
      "speech_type": "待分析",
      "is_highlight": false,
      "is_crash": false
    },
    {
      "segment_id": 7,
      "start_time": "00:03:00",
      "end_time": "00:03:30",
      "content": "有些宝宝问敏感肌能不能用，我跟你说，100% 没问题，我闺蜜敏感肌用了都说好。",
      "word_count": 39,
      "speech_type": "待分析",
      "is_highlight": false,
      "is_crash": false
    },
    {
      "segment_id": 8,
      "start_time": "00:03:30",
      "end_time": "00:04:00",
      "content": "库存真的不多了，后台显示只剩 80 单了，卖完真的要等下个月补货。",
      "word_count": 33,
      "speech_type": "待分析",
      "is_highlight": false,
      "is_crash": false
    },
    {
      "segment_id": 9,
      "start_time": "00:04:00",
      "end_time": "00:04:30",
      "content": "来，我们倒计时 5 分钟，5 分钟后恢复原价，到时候别怪我没提醒你们哦。",
      "word_count": 36,
      "speech_type": "待分析",
      "is_highlight": false,
      "is_crash": false
    },
    {
      "segment_id": 10,
      "start_time": "00:04:30",
      "end_time": "00:05:00",
      "content": "哎呀这个价格我真的亏死了，但是为了冲销量，拼了！",
      "word_count": 24,
      "speech_type": "待分析",
      "is_highlight": false,
